+- 실행한 명령
+  - `cmake --build core/build -j$(nproc)`
+  - `ctest --test-dir core/build --output-on-failure -R '^(test_multi_socket_contract_regressions|test_socket_with_handler|test_pubsub_filter_xpub|test_monitor_perf_contract)$' -j1`
